{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 27, :comments ["<b>When He established the heavens, there I was</b> — The bet of בהכינו is like the bet of בחוקו, בשומו, בעזוז, באמצו; all of them indicate time, and the intent is: I was present, or: nothing preceded me in creation. And the meaning of בהכינו is like: כונן שמים, and like: יהי רקיע." "<b>When He inscribed a circle</b> — At the time He inscribed the sphere upon the face of the deep, which is the center, and חוג is like וחוג שמים יתהלך. And the instrument made to produce the impression of circles is called מחוגה, after the חוג inscribed in it." "<b>And the word בחוקו</b> — Its proper form is to have a dagesh, for its root is חקק, from וחקות עליה. Or they may be two roots with one meaning: חקק and חוק, and from this root: מי יתן בספר ויוחקו."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 8, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:21:34.330664668Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}